  "description": "Special Offer: Add the SRAM Apex Gravel Build Kit to this frameset and save £250\nLooking for the perfect base to build your own custom-spec do-it-all, go-anywhere bike? Look no further. Our award-winning Kinesis G2 complete bike is now available as a frameset-only option for you to build up to your own specification.The Kinesis G2 is nimble off the line, fast handling and plenty tough enough for anything UK gravel riding will throw at you. The perfect all-seasons frameset for the rider that wants a fast adventure gravel bike, all year round for British summers and winter weather. A lightweight, premium quality 6061 aluminium tubeset complemented with our genre-defining UD carbon-fibre fork has created one of the best framesets on the market – at a very comfortable price-point. If you think custom-spec bikes are the preserve of the elite, we have other ideas. The Kinesis G2 is more capable than a road bike, more comfortable than a cyclocross bike and much more versatile than an out-and-out gravel bike\nKinesis G2 Video review“I've been riding all over on Kinesis G2 drop bar all-rounder for the past few months, so what are its strengths and weaknesses and where does it sit in the increasingly broad gravel / all-road spectrum of bikes?” – Guy Kesteven",
